pan style=\"font-size:16px;\">2004.12 ~ 2007.12 哈工大机电学院机器人研究所 讲师</span></h3>           <h3></h3>           <p><br></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">教育经历</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"61165f1c4c9648d3842cc9e6452cc5b5\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"ea4a691cfd75445a896e9e2889e4bf42\">           <p><br></p>           <h3><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2000~2004 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">哈尔滨工业大学 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">机电学院 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">博士</span></h3>           <h3><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">1998~2000 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">哈尔滨工业大学 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">机电学院 硕士</span></h3>           <h3><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">1994~1998 哈尔滨工业大学 实验学院/机电学院 本科 </span></h3>           <h3><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">1991~1994 哈尔滨市第三中学 高中</span> </h3>           <p><br></p>          </div>          </div> <grammarly-extension-vbars data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" class=\"dnXmp\" style=\"display: contents; --rem: 16;\"></grammarly-extension-vbars>        </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">奖项荣誉</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"4a32d31a681e47a3aa0cb104872c4215\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"1c123329bb1a4339b8754430dc3fff04\">           <p><br></p>           <h3><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2014年，黑龙江省科学技术发明一等奖；</span></h3>           <h3><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2014年，黑龙江省机械工业科学技术一等奖；</span></h3>           <h3><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2017年，龙江科技英才计划科技创新领军人才；</span></h3>           <h3><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2018年，中国自动化学会技术发明一等奖；</span></h3>           <h3 style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2019年，中国优秀工业设计金奖；</span> </h3>           <p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></p>           <h3 style=\"text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2021年，<span style=\"\">中国机械工业科学技术发明特等奖</span></span></h3>           <p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br></span></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>          </div> <grammarly-extension-vbars data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" class=\"dnXmp\" style=\"display: contents; --rem: 16;\"></grammarly-extension-vbars><grammarly-extension-vbars data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" class=\"dnXmp\" style=\"display: contents; --rem: 16;\"></grammarly-extension-vbars><grammarly-extension-vbars data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" class=\"dnXmp\" style=\"display: contents; --rem: 16;\"></grammarly-extension-vbars><grammarly-extension-vbars data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" class=\"dnXmp\" style=\"display: contents; --rem: 16;\"></grammarly-extension-vbars>        </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">主要任职</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"d2d8963141914e2b85c522b4467f7906\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"50c35ae7e4434ae6920473b8375f50c2\">           <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;\">            <li><p><strong>中国机器人学术年会组织委员会主席</strong></p></li>            <li><p><strong>国际计量测试联合会机器人分会（TC17）委员</strong></p></li>            <li><p><strong>中国电子学会机器人分会 副主任委员<br></strong></p></li>            <li><p><strong>中国机械工程学会机器人分会委员</strong></p></li>            <li><p><strong>中国宇航学会机器人专业委员会 执行委员<br></strong></p></li>            <li><p><strong>中国自动化学会共融机器人专业委员会委员</strong></p></li>            <li><p><strong>国际机构学和机器科学联合会（IFToMM）中国委员会委员</strong></p></li>           </ul>           <p><br></p>          </div>          </div> <grammarly-extension-vbars data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" class=\"dnXmp\" style=\"display: contents; --rem: 16;\"></grammarly-extension-vbars><grammarly-extension-vbars data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" class=\"dnXmp\" style=\"display: contents; --rem: 16;\"></grammarly-extension-vbars><grammarly-extension-vbars data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" class=\"dnXmp\" style=\"display: contents; --rem: 16;\"></grammarly-extension-vbars>        </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"tabb3587part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3101\"></i><em id=\"3101\" data-more=\"0\">研究方向一：可穿戴机器人</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"d37e4fa7f9074d9ca1879b213916f22c\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"c7ff9808efa49258f4875bb8bb8aeecb\">           <p style=\"text-indent:2em;\">可穿戴机器人是一种供人穿戴的人机一体化机械装置，包括外骨骼、外肢体等等，将人的智力和机器人的“体力”完美地结合在一起，依靠人的智力来控制机器人，使其与人高效协同工作，通过机器人完成人类自身能力无法完成的任务，实现真正的“人机一体”。随着社会快速的发展变化，人口老龄化问题、医疗康复问题以及地质灾害的频繁发生，都向辅助类机器人领域提出了新的需求，从而使各种助力机器人的研究成为热点。</p>           <p style=\"text-indent: 0em;\"><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">穿戴式外骨骼机器人</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"1f63509811a5f3336c070c2abf3d49eb\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"9e333e8efa49b828e5c7e02636b9b9b