pan></span></span></span> </p>            <p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong> 授课对象：博士生</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> </p>            <p><span><span><span><span>◎</span><strong>机器人运动控制技术（双语）</strong></span></span></span><span></span> </p>            <p><font><span> <strong>授课对象</strong>：</span><span><strong>机械工程专业本科生</strong></span></font> </p>            <p><span><span><span>◎<b>从钢铁侠到变形金刚-未来机器人</b></span></span></span> </p>            <p><span><span><strong> <span>授课对象</span></strong><span>：</span><span><strong>全校大一新生</strong></span></span></span> </p>            <p></p>           </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"tabb8228part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">招生信息</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"8e843aa6b9664aa686c6028fb97cacce\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"29541516c18c444a8be69a894db200c6\">           <p>机电工程学院招生：</p>           <p>博士2-3人，硕士2-3人</p>           <p><br></p>           <p>人工智能研究院招生：</p>           <p>博士1-2人，硕士1-2人</p>           <p><br></p>           <p>博士后：1-2人/年，机械工程博士后流动站</p>           <p><br></p>           <p>研究方向：①可穿戴机器人，②自重构机器人，③机器人+人工智能新方向</p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">新闻动态</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"a642a3e258b53196b8f65e8c25ffc0e7\" style=\"paddin