/span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种通过舌头操控的三维空间人机交互装置</span> ZL202211357224 <strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">朱延河</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">、荆泓玮等；</span></p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:52px\">3.<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种异构式负重外骨骼机器人</span> ZL202210869298 <strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">朱延河</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">、巨浩天等；</span></p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:52px\">4.<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种六自由度差分式绳驱机械臂</span> ZL202111562102 <strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">朱延河</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">、赵杰等；</span></p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:52px\">5.<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种可控阻尼的完全恒力悬浮背包装置</span> ZL202110301835 <strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">朱延河</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">、巨浩天等；</span></p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:52px\">6.<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种可调负载的恒力俘能发电背包</span> ZL202110097130 <strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">朱延河</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">、巨浩天等；</span></p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:52px\">7.<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">移动与穿戴双模式机器人</span> ZL202011568652 <strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">朱延河</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">、赵思恺等；</span></p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:52px\">8.<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种气弹簧储能被动型上肢助力外骨骼</span> ZL202010225907 <strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">朱延河</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">、滑宇翔等；</span></p>           <p cl