d=\"86e3a59355396860b6bc66e3455bc09a\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"557ff867a64bab6ddfae723e616608a6\">           <p><img src=\"http://homepage.hit.edu.cn/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220704/1656922581667020777.png\" title=\"1656922581667020777.png\" alt=\"图片.png\" width=\"766\" height=\"523\"></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>    <div id=\"bde3e9e250823cff7274a3d3ccbc13c0part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">Career Summary</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"ef647ac0484d54d3f447f484d1383248\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"b7fa85bb0174c687a8fef9b1d38381de\">           <p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; text-indent: 2em; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 24px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px;\">Yanhe </span>Zhu</span><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman;\">is the Deputy Director of the National Key Laboratory of Robotics and Systems, a Professor and doctoral supervisor at the School of Mechatronics Engineering, Harbin Institute of Technology (HIT), and the Chief Scientist of the HIT Institute for Artificial Intelligence. He was selected for China’s National High-level Talent Support Program (Ten Thousand Talents Program). His primary research areas include modular self-reconfigurable robots, wearable robots, and robots for extreme environments.</span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman;\">Zhu has led over 20 national-level projects, supported by organizations such as the NSFC, the National Key Research and Development Program, the National Science and Technology Major Project, the Fusion Energy Research Program, and China’s Manned Space Program. His research achievements are successfully applied in fields such as manned spaceflight, nuclear power operation and maintenance, disaster relief, and medical rehabilitation.</span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman;\">Zhu has published more than 120 significant peer-reviewed papers, holds over 110 invention patents in China and abroad, and has received the National Gold Award for Industrial Design along with four first-class prizes in provincial and ministerial Science and Technology awards.</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; text-indent: 2em; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: timesNewRoman;\"></span><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3101\"></i><em id=\"3101\" data-more=\"0\">Research Interest</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"1293e694e52abfce65ce61c177958425\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"95d3d5684338120119a213bbd8b0312c\">           <h3><strong><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman;\">Wearable Robotics</span></strong></h3>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\">Wearable robots are human-worn systems (e.g., Exoskeleton robot, Supernumerary Robotic Limb) that couple user intent with robotic actuation to extend physical capabilities and enable efficient human–robot collaboration. Rising needs from population aging, rehabilitation, and disaster response have made assistive and power-assistance robotics a major research focus.</span></p>           <h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman;\">Modular Self-Reconfigurable Robots</span></strong></h3>           <p style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\">Modular self-reconfigurable robots are composed of modules with sensing and locomotion functions, which can reorganize their morphology to meet task requirements. Their high adaptability makes them particularly suitable for use in variable or constrained environments—such as space operations, emergency rescue, and nuclear facility maintenance.</span></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">Honors &amp; Awards</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"d24cc54b33ba834349c713df9bbb75c5\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"b346627056e459e45b2a1baca57eae2c\">           <ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\">2014 — Heilongjiang Provincial Science and Technology Invention Award, First Prize (ranked first).</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\">2014 — Heilongjiang Provincial Mechanical Industry Science and Technology Award, First Prize (ranked first).</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\">2017 — Selected as a Leading Talent for Scientific and Technological Innovation under the “Longjiang Science &amp; Technology Talent Program” .</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\">2018 — “Science China” Person of the Year (2017).</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\">2019 — China Excellent Industrial Design Award (Gold Prize).</span><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\"></span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">Major Appointments</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"2a848cf139b827eaa387bdaac345b002\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"687c8bf5a93937311400304861e76cde\">           <ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Expert</strong>, Expert Panel for the Key Special Project “High-Performance Manufacturing Technology and Major Equipment”, National Key R&amp;D Program.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Chair </strong>of the Organizing Committee, China Robotics Academic Conference (2018, 2019, 2022)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Member</strong>, Technical Committee TC17 (Measurement in Robotics), International Measurement Confederation (IMEKO).</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Member</strong>, Robotics Division, Chinese Mechanical Engineering Society (CMES)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Member</strong>, Professional Committee on Tri-Co / Coexisting Robots, Chinese Association of Automation.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Member</strong>, Technical Committee on Virtual Reality and Human–Computer Interaction, China Command and Control Society.</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Member</strong>, Chinese Committee for the International Federation for the Promotion of Mechanism and Machine Science (IFToMM)</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Director</strong>, Heilongjiang Association for Artificial Intelligence</span></p></li>           </ul>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>   </div>   </div> </body></html>"